    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Create a Social Web App\r\n\r\nWith the help of AI, complete the missing code in `script.js` to make Keep the Streak app work.\r\n\r\n**How do I start?**\r\n1. Create a variable for `streak`\r\n2. Complete `streakBtn` event handler \r\n3. Complete `boostBtn` event handler\r\n4. Complete `resetBtn` event handler",
